---
hvy_version: 0.1
title: Notifications Demo
reader_max_width: 48rem
plugins:
  - id: galaxy.notifications
    permissions:
      - scripting
  - id: hvy.scripting
  - id: hvy.form
---

<!--hvy: {"id":"try-it","lock":false,"expanded":true,"highlight":false}-->
#! Notifications

 <!--hvy:text {"id":"how-to"}-->
 Press **Notify** for a system notification. Clicking it brings Galaxy forward with this document, at the section named in Target. To check a background tab, press Notify, switch to another tab or minimize Galaxy, then click the notification. **Notify 6 times** shows the limit: 3 in 5 seconds, then the rest are dropped.

 <!--hvy:plugin {"id":"notify-form","plugin":"hvy.form","pluginConfig":{"version":"0.1","showSubmit":true,"formCss":"","actionsCss":"","submitCss":"","initialScript":"","changeScript":"","submitAction":"script","submitSourceScript":"","submitScript":"notify","submitPrompt":"","submitInputCharLimit":4000,"submitOutputCharLimit":4000,"submitLabel":"Notify","submitDisabled":false,"submitDisabledReason":"","scriptLibraries":[],"scriptStepBudget":100000}}-->
  fields:
    - label: Title
      type: text
      placeholder: Job search
    - label: Body
      type: text
      placeholder: 3 new postings match
    - label: Target
      type: text
      placeholder: found-it
  scripts:
    notify: |
      title = str(doc.form.get_value("Title") or "") or "Job search"
      body = str(doc.form.get_value("Body") or "") or "3 new postings match"
      target = str(doc.form.get_value("Target") or "") or "found-it"
      shown = doc.plugins.call("galaxy.notifications", "notify", {"title": title, "body": body, "target": target})
      doc.component.set_text("notify-status", "Shown." if shown else "Dropped: over the limit.")

 <!--hvy:plugin {"id":"notify-burst","plugin":"hvy.form","pluginConfig":{"version":"0.1","showSubmit":true,"formCss":"","actionsCss":"","submitCss":"","initialScript":"","changeScript":"","submitAction":"script","submitSourceScript":"","submitScript":"burst","submitPrompt":"","submitInputCharLimit":4000,"submitOutputCharLimit":4000,"submitLabel":"Notify 6 times","submitDisabled":false,"submitDisabledReason":"","scriptLibraries":[],"scriptStepBudget":100000}}-->
  fields: []
  scripts:
    burst: |
      results = []
      for n in range(1, 7):
          shown = doc.plugins.call("galaxy.notifications", "notify", {"title": "Burst " + str(n), "body": "Notification " + str(n) + " of 6", "target": "found-it"})
          results.append(str(n) + ": " + ("shown" if shown else "dropped"))
      doc.component.set_text("notify-status", ", ".join(results))

 <!--hvy:text {"id":"notify-status"}-->

